# AfriPay Frontend Environment Variables

Copy to `frontend/.env.local` for local development.

```env
# Backend API base URL (when frontend API integration is added)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_KEY=

# Stellar network shown in the UI (testnet by default)
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_NETWORK=testnet
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org
NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYMENT_GATEWAY_CONTRACT_ID=CB656MBZCHK5BMYUVNJQYAFIAWFNJZ2PASDYU7WCSVX34SUC6E5M3VCG
NEXT_PUBLIC_ESCROW_CONTRACT_ID=CCAL4FLLFKKCAT5NBFSDB7RH6GJYNBAPBJNIIJO5PZOEPHB23HXGCTCY
NEXT_PUBLIC_MULTISIG_CONTRACT_ID=CC2KFAKQMON3TZ6L2LEUXOTGZHMDBYVTV5XJR2O24NKPJTEYHJJXIA67
NEXT_PUBLIC_SAVINGS_VAULT_CONTRACT_ID=CAT5D3LJHARIS7GNGCWABZGOQG64JZZLDG4IMRJ22CPNU37A3G5DX5II
```

Never commit real secrets.
